Error: Jet.ProgramEntryMixed: Top-level statements at `program_entry_mixed_reexport.jet:5` and the `run` import at `hub.jet:4` are two entries of one program
  --> Tests/UI/program_entry_mixed_reexport.jet:5:1
    |
  5 | print(hub.greeting())
    | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: A program is script style, its entry file's top-level statements, or one `run: fn`, never both, so it starts in one place
 Fix: Move the statements into the function the `run` import names, or rename the import so the statements run
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.ProgramEntryMixed
